# What the dependences of this file have to come out as.
#
# S_3 writes c.f and S_2 reads c.u: one memory under two types, so the
# read of the next iteration must not be moved over the write of this
# one.  Given a space each -- which is right for a struct and wrong for a
# union -- the two look independent and only the S_2 self-edge is left.
dep_false *: .*S_3\[[a-z_0-9]+\] -> S_2\[[a-z_0-9]+'\]
